Sval: closing a tab opened from a pin returns to the pin

Closing the selected tab returns to the tab that opened it only while
that opener is visible. A pin's page is a hidden tab whenever it is not
selected, so a tab opened from a pin and closed went to a neighbouring
tab of the workspace instead of the page the user was on.

